<title>FRANCE: Iran seeks 50,000 tonnes October barley.</title>
<headline>Iran seeks 50,000 tonnes October barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran is in the grain market on Tuesday night for 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley for October shipment, European traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The barley is to be priced on a fob basis, they said.  </p>
<p>Traders said price levels were likely to be influenced by a much larger Saudi barley tender for one million tonnes, which was expected to be finalised overnight.</p>
</text>
